          "description": "Stores a memory in the Forge Vault (AES-256-GCM at rest) via REST — the REST equivalent of the save_to_synapse MCP tool / Synapse.store(). Requires a valid connect token sent in the x-connect-token header (Authorization: Bearer is also accepted by the runtime); without one the runtime returns 401 (\"Missing x-connect-token header or Authorization: Bearer token.\", code MISSING_TOKEN). Only POST is allowed (GET returns 405).",
